<section class="section page-intro">
  <h1>Free participation. Transparent marketplace commission.</h1>
  <p>The directory, organization profiles, listings and non-commercial exchange are free. There is no paid membership at launch. The standard marketplace commission is 10 percent of the product subtotal.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Founding Organizations</h2>
  <p>The first 50 approved organizations receive a permanent public Founder badge. If a Founder becomes an active seller, its commission is 7 percent for 12 months from first marketplace activation, then its configured standard rate applies. A lower custom rate is never increased to 7 percent.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>No subscription or listing fee</h2>
  <p>Organizations do not pay a recurring membership or per-listing fee. The platform commission does not apply to the seller's shipping charge. Allocation of Stripe processing, refund and dispute costs must be fixed in the seller agreement before payments are enabled.</p>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <h2>Seller-specific shipping</h2>
  <p>Each seller defines destination zones and rates. Buyers see one payment, while the order remains grouped by seller.</p>
</section>
